Description: CybroidOS Desktop: KDE Plasma 6 in the CybroidOS Horizon look
 A modern desktop for CybroidOS: KDE Plasma 6 on X11 with a slim top bar (menu,
 the app's own menu, tray, clock) and a floating dock, the CybroidOS Horizon
 colours (navy, cyan and blue), WhiteSur app icons (cybroid-icons; Papirus
 as the fallback), Inter and JetBrains Mono,
 a CybroidOS sign-in screen (SDDM) and splash, the CybroidOS boot splash
 (Plymouth), Firefox ESR with CybroidOS's start page and bookmarks, and xrdp
 for Remote Desktop. With what a computer needs day to day: Wi-Fi, mobile
 broadband and Bluetooth, the touchpad, sound, USB drives and phones,
 printing, media playback (VLC), documents (Okular), an app centre (Discover
 with Flathub), zsh with suggestions from history, and zram for small
 memory. Defaults only: each person can change them.
